WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.458 --> 00:00:01.833
Anybody home?

00:00:02.750 --> 00:00:05.750
Do you know who I am?

00:00:08.042 --> 00:00:10.750
I know what you are.

00:00:10.833 --> 00:00:12.250
That is enough.

00:00:17.792 --> 00:00:20.292
Bring me the ugly one.

00:00:21.458 --> 00:00:22.667
Come on!

00:00:25.167 --> 00:00:26.167
Wheeljack!

00:00:34.750 --> 00:00:38.167
The future… is unwritten.

00:00:40.083 --> 00:00:41.792
Focus your mind.

00:00:42.375 --> 00:00:45.208
Take us to the AllSpark.

00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:49.667
I hate to break it
to the Decepticons,

00:00:49.750 --> 00:00:52.042
but they’ve already won the war.

00:00:54.750 --> 00:00:56.125
Not yet, they haven’t.

00:00:58.333 --> 00:01:01.667
There’s still some spark
left in my circuits.

00:01:03.458 --> 00:01:06.250
I’m so glad
someone on our team can fly!

00:01:07.125 --> 00:01:10.292
You’ll never escape
this dead place.

00:01:12.125 --> 00:01:14.833
You must stay on the path…

00:01:17.083 --> 00:01:20.708
or a much darker future awaits.

00:01:25.792 --> 00:01:28.917
I will guide you
to your rightful destiny.

00:01:31.750 --> 00:01:34.417
You will kill Optimus Prime

00:01:35.250 --> 00:01:38.292
and take the Matrix for yourself.

00:01:43.625 --> 00:01:47.750
I don’t trust you.

00:01:48.250 --> 00:01:50.000
Good.

00:01:50.083 --> 00:01:53.958
Never trust anyone.

